    S1["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 1: Market Data Ingestion & Exchange Synchronization</b><br/>• <b>Official Sources</b>: Ingests NSE <code>EQUITY_L.csv</code> (2,639 listed stocks) & BSE corporate directory.<br/>• <b>Price Feeds & Macro</b>: Fetches daily OHLCV price histories from Yahoo Finance & RBI repo rate bulletins.<br/>• <b>Storage</b>: <code>exchange_universe_sync.py</code> reconciles ISINs into PostgreSQL: <code>securities</code>, <code>market_prices</code>.</div>"]:::s1

    S2["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 2: Investor Input & Suitability Profiling (Web UI)</b><br/>• <b>Web Views</b>: Investor interacts with <code>OnboardingWizard.tsx</code> & <code>PortfolioGenerator.tsx</code>.<br/>• <b>Parameters</b>: Inputs capital (e.g. ₹2,50,000), investment horizon, risk questionnaire answers, and sector exclusions.<br/>• <b>FastAPI Routers</b>: <code>api/v1/risk_assessments.py</code> & <code>goals.py</code> save records to <code>risk_assessments</code>, <code>financial_goals</code>.</div>"]:::s2

    S3["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 3: Multi-Agent Stock Research (LangGraph 13-Node Flow)</b><br/>• <b>Screening Filter</b>: <code>CandidateUniverseSelector</code> screens full catalog into 2,605 active liquid securities across 4 liquidity tiers.<br/>• <b>Research Agents (Gemini 3.8)</b>: <code>macro_analyst</code>, <code>market_analyst</code>, <code>fundamental_analyst</code>, <code>news_analyst</code>.<br/>• <b>Strategy & Risk Audit</b>: <code>analyst_node</code> (Lead Strategist) proposes weights; <code>critic_node</code> audits 25% single-stock & 40% sector limits.</div>"]:::s3

    S4["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 4: Quantitative Math Optimization & Integer Lot Sizing</b><br/>• <b>Quadratic Solver</b>: <code>optimizer.py</code> (SciPy SLSQP) optimizes continuous weights to maximize Sharpe ratio.<br/>• <b>Whole Shares</b>: <code>allocation_rounding.py</code> rounds continuous percentages into discrete executable whole shares.<br/>• <b>Cash & Taxes</b>: Preserves leftover cash reserve; <code>transaction_costs.py</code> calculates statutory Indian STT, GST, and stamp duty.</div>"]:::s4

    S5["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 5: Verification, Stock-Why Explanations & Database Commit</b><br/>• <b>Final Audit</b>: <code>critic_final_validation_node</code> verifies whole shares satisfy all diversification constraints.<br/>• <b>Explainability</b>: <code>moderator_explanation_node</code> & <code>stock_why_service.py</code> generate retail narrative & financial scorecard.<br/>• <b>ACID Commit</b>: <code>persistence_node</code> commits versioned portfolio atomically to PostgreSQL: <code>portfolios</code>, <code>holdings</code>.</div>"]:::s5

    S6["<div style='width: 760px; text-align: left; padding: 4px 8px;'><b>Stage 6: Client Presentation & Continuous Market-Hours Monitoring</b><br/>• <b>Dashboard</b>: Next.js renders <code>HoldingsView.tsx</code> ('My Portfolio'), <code>StockWhyModal.tsx</code>, and <code>StressScenariosView.tsx</code>.<br/>• <b>Live Monitor</b>: <code>monitoring_scheduler.py</code> tracks live prices every 5 minutes during exchange hours (09:15-15:30 IST).<br/>• <b>Drift Alert</b>: If holdings drift >= 5%, triggers <code>NotificationsPanel.tsx</code> and prepares <code>RebalancePreviewModal.tsx</code>.</div>"]:::s6

    S1 ==> S2 ==> S3 ==> S4 ==> S5 ==> S6
